{"id":"9e0500c2bc141b62","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-standard-gnf.md","title":"Greibach Normal Form","display":"df-greibach-normal-form — Greibach Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-standard-gnf","aliases":["73-df-standard-gnf","73-df-greibach-normal-form"],"display":"df-greibach-normal-form — Greibach Normal Form","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-standard-gnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-standard-gnf</span><span>73-df-greibach-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-greibach-normal-form — Greibach Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every non-epsilon production emits exactly one terminal before a string of nonterminals; the former unbound display <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to a\\beta\">\\(A\\to a\\beta\\)</span> has been absorbed into the quantified clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\,\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;(\\alpha=a\\beta)\n\\;\\lor\\;\n(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;(S\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}greibach\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{GNF}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}:\\operatorname{GNF}(G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to a\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1117,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}